WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.650
Apps have panels: rows of buttons that change what the program does.

2
00:00:05.551 --> 00:00:09.826
Instead of an if for every button, the buttons are kept in lists.

3
00:00:10.627 --> 00:00:13.427
One loop draws a button for every name.

4
00:00:14.331 --> 00:00:18.631
Another loop checks each button in turn, to find which one was clicked.

5
00:00:23.305 --> 00:00:28.130
Adding a button is one more item in each list. Gradio works this way.
